{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And Moses said to Joshua.</b> Moses acted with wisdom when he recognized the sin, for it was on account of neglecting the war of Torah. He said: it is not fitting to go out to battle except Joshua, concerning whom it is stated (Exodus 33:11) ״לֹא יָמִישׁ מִתּוֹךְ הָאֹהֶל״ — in the matter of Torah. And he told him to choose men like himself, and by this he would prevail over him, and so it was."], :book :exodus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:29:15.376779923Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}